# Alembic migrations live here.

Bootstrap notes:
- Enable pgvector on Postgres: CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS vector;
  (done automatically in 0001_initial_core / 0002_rag_chunks when dialect is postgresql)
- Core domains: users, documents, jobs (0001); document_chunks + documents.extracted_text (0002)
- document_chunks.embedding is pgvector ``vector`` on Postgres; JSON text on SQLite for unit tests
